{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47376","headline":"元日言怀因以自励诒诸同志 · 吴筠","name":"元日言怀因以自励诒诸同志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驰光无时憩，加我五十年。\n知非慕伯玉，读易宗文宣。\n经世匪吾事，庶几唯道全。\n谁言帝乡远，自古多真仙。\n余滓永可涤，秉心方杳然。\n孰能无相与，灭迹俱忘筌。\n安用感时变，当期升九天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47376.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47376","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}